{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22197","headline":"泛湓水 · 白居易","name":"泛湓水","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"四月未全热，麦凉江气秋。\n湖山处处好，最爱湓水头。\n湓水从东来，一派入江流。\n可怜似萦带，中有随风舟。\n命酒一临泛，舍鞍扬櫂讴。\n放回岸傍马，去逐波间鸥。\n烟浪始渺渺，风襟亦悠悠。\n初疑上河汉，中若寻瀛洲。\n汀树绿拂地，沙草芳未休。\n青萝与紫葛，枝蔓垂相樛。\n系缆步平岸，回头望江州。\n城雉映水见，隐隐如蜃楼。\n日入意未尽，将归复少留。\n到官行半岁，今日方一游。\n此地来何暮，可以写吾忧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22197.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22197","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}